# Per-user state — rooms and their workspaces, agent roster, hidden-project list,
# the generated MCP config. These live in AGENT_TERMINAL_HOME (default
# ~/.agent-terminal), not the checkout, so two people sharing this repo don't
# share or overwrite each other's work. Listed here as well so an existing clone
# that still has them on disk doesn't re-commit them.
projects/
agents.json
closed.json
mcp-roblox.json
.claude/
